      "rationale": "Introduce jointly learned diagonal bilinear compatibility with bounded weights 1 + 0.5*tanh(a), initialized to preserve existing scores. This may suppress noisy interest coordinates while preserving the GRU, history readout, loss, and optimizer. The generated predictor imports the updated model class and loads its learned interaction parameter from the single checkpoint per category.",
